            <description><![CDATA[<h2>atmOSphere 0.8.35</h2>
<ul>
<li>Leaflet articles now show figures and supported video embeds in their original order.</li>
<li>Click article images to enlarge them. Image space is reserved while loading to keep the text steady.</li>
<li>YouTube and Vimeo videos load when clicked. Other embedded content has a link to open it in your browser.</li>
<li>Previously cached articles refresh automatically to pick up their missing media.</li>
<li>Includes the recent themed icons, GIF layout, notification, and engagement-control fixes.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
