            <description><![CDATA[<h2>atmOSphere 0.8.31</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Report a bug</strong> includes the app version, build number, and macOS version in the email draft.</li>
<li>Reply uses the same muted color as other inactive post actions.</li>
<li>Checkboxes follow your selected theme, including in Publications.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
